; Live-CD setup: writable examples first, read-only tools/SDK second.
FailAt 10
If NOT EXISTS RAM:Development
  MakeDir RAM:Development
EndIf
If NOT EXISTS RAM:Development/Examples
  MakeDir RAM:Development/Examples
EndIf
If NOT EXISTS RAM:Development/Examples/HelloAROS
  Copy SYS:Development/Examples/HelloAROS RAM:Development/Examples/HelloAROS ALL QUIET
EndIf
Assign Development: RAM:Development
Assign Development: SYS:Development ADD
; Fresh Workbench shells search C:, not the startup CLI path.
Assign C: Development:bin ADD
Path Development:bin ADD
SetEnv PATH "/Development/bin:/C"
Echo "Native project ready at Development:Examples/HelloAROS"
